Usage: agent-deck migrate-paths [--dry-run] [--force]

Copy legacy ~/.agent-deck files into the XDG config/data/cache layout
and pin the XDG data dir as the active profile store root
(profiles/.active-root). An empty stray XDG profiles/ directory is
set aside as profiles.stray-<timestamp> first. The legacy directory
is left untouched.

Options:
  --dry-run  Show what would be copied without writing files
  --force    Merge legacy into existing XDG locations. Per-file
             conflicts PRESERVE the existing (newer) XDG file and
             are reported; XDG-only data is never deleted.
